SUMMARY:Galactic Empire and All Sabers proudly present: GALACTIC-CON
DESCRIPTION:Saturday May 2nd\, 2026\nDoors | 5:45 PM\nShow | 6:45 PM \nGeneral Admission Standing Room | $29.55 + Fees\nReserved Balcony & Mezzanine Seating | $29.55 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n————————————————–\nPresented by Galactic Empire & All Sabers\n————————————————–\nGalactic Empire and All Sabers proudly present GALACTIC CON — a sci-fi convention experience like no other. \nLIVE MUSIC\nGalactic Empire — The most sinister metal band in the galaxy\, Metal renditions of the most iconic movie scores ever written. Star Wars. Indiana Jones. Jurassic Park. All performed live in full costume. \nKnorrwood — Lord of the Rings + Led Zeppelin tribute \nMadame Saber \nACTIVITIES & EXPERIENCES\nBuild Your Own Lightsaber — Interactive build stations presented by All Sabers\nLive Saber Duels — Choreographed lightsaber combat demonstrations\nCosplay Costume Contest — All ages\, prizes awarded\nVendor Village — Collectibles\, art\, apparel\, gaming gear\, custom props\, and more\nRetro Gaming Lounge — Classic consoles and mini-tournaments\nPhoto Op Stations — Themed sci-fi backdrops\nFull bar\nFood vendors onsite\nFamily friendly. Cosplay encouraged. All ages welcome. \nVENDORS & SPONSORS\n– All Sabers\n– Complete In Box\n– Atrium Media\n– Woodcrest Audio \nVIP Experience – Click here to purchase VIP Add On (this add on does not include a ticket to the main Galactic Con event)\nWhat’s Included:\n-Early Entry\n-Exclusive VIP Challenge Coin\n-Meet & Greet + Photo Op with Band\n-VIP Laminate + Lanyard\n-Priority Viewing\n-Exclusive VIP Swag Bag\n————————————————–\n*Ticket Alert* \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers. Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets. Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/galactic-empire/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2026/03/GALACTIC_CON_TM-2048x1152px.jpg
END:VEVENT
