SUMMARY:Absolute Adele with Jennifer Cella *rescheduled date*
DESCRIPTION:Saturday May 9th\, 2026\nRescheduled from December 27th\, 2025 \nDoors | 7:00 PM\nShow | 8:00 PM \nReserved Balcony & Mezzanine Seating | $33.55 + Fees\nReserved Riser Seating | $44.30 + Fees\nReserved Orchestra Seating | $54.55 + Fees \n+$5 on All Day of Show Purchases\nThis event is all ages – 21+ With Valid ID to Drink\nCome hungry! Snacks and light bites will be available at the canteen.\n—————————————————\nPresented by Big Fan Presents\n—————————————————\nThere’s only one Adele… and one Absolute Adele. Step into a world of breathtaking vocals\, soul-stirring emotion\, and unforgettable hits with Absolute Adele featuring Jennifer Cella — the most authentic and powerful tribute to Adele on the planet. \nFronted by powerhouse vocalist Jennifer Cella\, this show is more than just a tribute — it’s a stunning recreation of Adele’s iconic sound and presence. Known worldwide for her soaring vocals as a lead vocalist for the multi-platinum\, Billboard-chart-topping Trans-Siberian Orchestra\, Jennifer brings a level of artistry and credibility few performers can match. \nJennifer’s extraordinary voice can be heard on TSO’s hit albums The Lost Christmas Eve\, Nightcastle\, and Letters from the Labyrinth\, which have earned gold and platinum status and dominated the Billboard charts. Her dynamic stage presence has electrified audiences around the world\, and she’s shared the stage with Rock & Roll Hall of Famers Joan Jett and Roger Daltrey\, as well as Jon Anderson of Yes\, among others. \nIn Absolute Adele\, Jennifer channels the raw emotion\, powerhouse vocal range\, and British charm that have made Adele a global icon. From the haunting ballads of “Someone Like You” to the anthemic “Rolling in the Deep”\, Jennifer delivers every note with jaw-dropping precision and heartfelt authenticity. Her voice doesn’t just sound like Adele — it feels like Adele. \nBacking Jennifer is a band of world-class musicians whose résumés read like a who’s who of the music industry. These elite players have performed and toured with the likes of Whitney Houston\, Mariah Carey\, Stevie Wonder\, Olivia Newton-John\, Ray Charles\, Michael Bolton\, and Taylor Dayne\, and are regularly featured in Broadway productions. Together\, they create an epic\, live concert experience that is as musically masterful as it is emotionally moving. \nWhether you’re a die-hard Adele fan or simply love great music performed at the highest level\, Absolute Adele with Jennifer Cella is a show you must experience. This is not an imitation — it’s a tribute in the truest sense: passionate\, powerful\, and unforgettable. \nFeel every word. Hear every note. Believe again in the magic of live music. \nThis is Absolute Adele. \nCheck out Absolute Adele here!\nWebsite | Instagram |  Facebook\n—————————————————\n*Ticket Alert*  \nTickets for Mickey’s Black Box are sold through TicketMaster\, via our website\, or in person at our Box Office. Any tickets purchased elsewhere will not be honored and we are not responsible for tickets purchased from any 3rd party sellers.  Do not google the name of the band to search for tickets.  Go to Mickeysblackbox.com ONLY. Mickeysblackbox.com will never direct you anywhere but the official TicketMaster event site. \n\nAll bags are subject are to search upon entry. Tickets are non-refundable\, save for instances in which performances are cancelled by Mickey’s Black Box. For more information about our venue or to make an ADA request\, please visit the FAQ page of our website: https://mickeysblackbox.com/faq/ or call our box office line at (717) 723 – 8463.
URL:https://mickeysblackbox.com/event/christmas-with-absolute-adele/
LOCATION:Mickey’s Black Box\, 101 Rock Lititz Boulevard\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mickeysblackbox.com/app/uploads/2025/09/Untitled-43-e1772565489781.jpeg
END:VEVENT
